ConformanceUnit.Description:
The SecureChannelEnhancements are used.
The SecureChannelEnhancements incorporate changes to how the SecureChannels work including:
 - a new signature calculation method for OpenSecureChannel responses;
 - shared secret chaining when re-calculating symmetric keys after renewal;
 - all signatures exchanged in CreateSession/ActivateSession handshake require additional data;
 - added additional requirements when calling ActivateSession over a new SecureChannel;
 - the algorithm field in SignatureData instances shall be NULL or empty and receivers shall ignore the value.
